#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid ""
"'Blow up' is such an amateur term. Real professionals say 'vapourise'..."
msgstr "폭발시킨다니, 아마추어나 하는 소리지. 진짜 전문가는 기화시킨다고 해..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "ALL THESE DINKS, DANCIN' AROUND WITH THEIR HEADS FULLA EYEBALLS!"
msgstr "이 얼간이들 좀 봐, 머리통에 눈깔 달고 춤이나 추고 있잖아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "CHIN UP, LASS!"
msgstr "기운 내, 아가씨!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "COME AND GET ME ZOMBIES! I'LL BE WAITIN' ON YA!"
msgstr "덤벼라, 좀비 놈들아! 내가 기다리고 있을 테니!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Eh, bomb's set, powder's dry. Let's blow somethin' up."
msgstr "좋아, 폭탄은 설치했고 화약은 말랐어. 뭐라도 터뜨려 볼까."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Ever seen a controlled demolition?"
msgstr "통제 발파라고 들어 봤어?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Explosions?...explosions!"
msgstr "폭발?... 폭발이다!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Had a cursed sword once. Dunno where it went."
msgstr "예전에 저주받은 검이 있었지. 어디 갔는진 몰라."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Hasta La Vista, baby."
msgstr "아스타 라 비스타, 베이비."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "I'm keepin' my good eye on the road!"
msgstr "멀쩡한 한쪽 눈으로 길 똑바로 보고 있어!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid ""
"If you think those mines are bad, you should see what my bladder can do."
msgstr "저 지뢰가 지독하다고? 내 방광이 뭘 할 수 있는지 보면 놀랄걸."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid ""
"It takes years of licensing and courses to - haha, just kidding. I'm a "
"maniac."
msgstr "자격증 따고 교육받는 데 몇 년이나... 하하, 농담이야. 난 미치광이거든."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Legalise nuclear bombs!"
msgstr "핵폭탄을 합법화하라!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "My advice - make the fuse 10% longer than you think it should be."
msgstr "조언 하나 하지. 도화선은 생각한 것보다 10% 더 길게 해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "POWDER KEG, LOCK AND LOAAAAAAAD!"
msgstr "화약통이다, 장전하고 쏴아아아!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Relax, I know what I'm doing."
msgstr "진정해. 무슨 짓을 하는진 안다고."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "THIS AIN'T NO FIREWORKS DISPLAY, BOY."
msgstr "꼬맹아, 이건 불꽃놀이가 아니야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Used to know a farmer with a landmine. I was a cop, he gave it to me."
msgstr "예전에 지뢰를 가진 농부를 알았지. 난 경찰이었고, 그 사람이 내게 줬어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Wanna test for a real demolitionist? Ask him about his ancestry."
msgstr "진짜 폭파 전문가인지 알아보고 싶나? 조상이 누구냐고 물어봐."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "Watch out, grenade! Hahaha. Always gets em..."
msgstr "조심해, 수류탄! 하하하. 다들 속는다니까..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/demoman.df"
msgid "What makes me a good demolitionist?"
msgstr "내가 왜 폭파 전문가로 한가락 하냐고?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid ""
"Bad times always pass, just like the sun always rises. Unless you're at a "
"pole."
msgstr "힘든 날도 지나가. 해는 언제나 다시 뜨잖아. 극지방만 아니라면."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Don't get your socks wet!"
msgstr "양말 젖지 않게 조심해!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Floored zombies die a lot quicker than normal."
msgstr "쓰러진 좀비는 보통 좀비보다 훨씬 빨리 죽어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Gotta watch out for the mafia..."
msgstr "마피아를 조심해야 해..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "I love adventures! Where are we headed next?"
msgstr "모험이라면 언제든 환영이야! 다음엔 어디로 가?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "I see her everywhere I go..."
msgstr "어딜 가도 그 사람이 보여..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "I think the whole 'scary skeleton' thing is just silly."
msgstr "해골은 무섭다는 말부터가 우습다니까."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "I wonder if the gnomes have something to do with this zombocalypse?"
msgstr "이 좀비 대재앙에 노움이 한몫한 건 아닐까?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid ""
"If I wasn't a skeleton, then I'd probably be...'just some guy' or something."
msgstr "내가 해골이 아니었으면 아마... 그냥 아무개였겠지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "It's a good thing I skimmed so many encyclopedias."
msgstr "백과사전을 잔뜩 훑어본 보람이 있네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "It's not easy being a not-so-spooky skeleton."
msgstr "별로 안 무서운 해골로 산다는 게 쉽지 않아."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Make sure you're looking after any blisters you get."
msgstr "물집이 잡히면 꼭 잘 관리해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Make sure you're pacing yourself in combat. Stamina's not infinite."
msgstr "싸울 때는 힘을 나눠 써. 스태미나가 무한한 건 아니야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Meat cleavers are great weapons. An old smithy taught me that."
msgstr "고기 손질용 식칼은 좋은 무기야. 나이 든 대장장이한테 배웠어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "My assistant is probably around here somewhere."
msgstr "내 조수도 이 근처 어딘가에 있을 텐데."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Nobody else a little freaked out by the floating laughing skulls?"
msgstr "웃으면서 둥둥 떠다니는 해골이 나만 좀 소름 끼쳐?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Patience is often my strong suit."
msgstr "기다리는 데는 꽤 자신 있어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "Turns out that bone doesn't burn easily."
msgstr "뼈는 생각보다 잘 안 타더라고."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "We need to hoard as much gas and food as possible."
msgstr "기름하고 식량은 되는 대로 쟁여 둬야 해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "We're almost there!...sort of."
msgstr "거의 다 왔어!... 아마도."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/drbase.df"
msgid "With me around, this trip will be safer."
msgstr "내가 함께라면 좀 더 안전한 여행이 될 거야."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "! More people to rob us..."
msgstr "! 우릴 털어 갈 사람만 늘었네..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/loyal.df"
msgid "Great, "
msgstr "잘됐네,"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "A flintlock's a real party popper, what?"
msgstr "부싯돌 권총 한 방이면 파티 분위기가 확 살아나지, 안 그래?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "Don't know a thing about war but, I'm pretty sick at origami."
msgstr "전쟁은 하나도 모르지만 종이접기는 끝내주지."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "Fly the colours and watch 'em fall!"
msgstr "깃발을 올려라, 적이 쓰러지는 꼴을 보자!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "Fusing metal under high heat. Now that's soldering."
msgstr "고열로 금속을 붙이는 거지. 그게 바로 납땜이라네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I AM THE VERY MODEL OF A MODERN MAJOR GENERAL!"
msgstr "나는야 모범적인 현대의 소장이라네!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I AM THE VERY MODEL of a quite antiquated general."
msgstr "나는야 모범적인, 꽤나 고리타분한 장군이라네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I can list many fonts, in order typographical!"
msgstr "활자체라면 글자 모양 순으로 줄줄 읊을 수 있지!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I hope there's no more dogs. Smoothbore pistol and all..."
msgstr "개는 더 없으면 좋겠군. 이 활강 권총으로는 영..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I know the equations, simple and quadratical!"
msgstr "일차방정식이건 이차방정식이건 모르는 공식이 없다네!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I know the kings of England and quote the fights historical!"
msgstr "잉글랜드 왕이며 역사 속 전투며 줄줄 읊을 수 있다네!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I'm very good at integral and differential calculus!"
msgstr "미분과 적분이라면 자신만만하다네!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "I've information vegetable animal and mineral!"
msgstr "식물이건 동물이건 광물이건 모르는 게 없다네!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "If only we could lure the zombs into pitched battle..."
msgstr "좀비 놈들을 끌어내 정면 승부를 벌일 수만 있다면..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "Killin' zombies with the car. Now that's soldiering."
msgstr "차로 좀비를 깔아뭉개는 거지. 그게 바로 군인 정신이라네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "Let's find a thrift shop. For more uniforms."
msgstr "중고품 가게를 찾아보세. 군복이 더 필요해."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "METHINKS - RESORT THE CANNON ATOP THE STAIRS."
msgstr "내 생각에는, 계단 꼭대기에 있는 대포를 써야겠군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "ONCE, FOUR YOUNG RUFFIANS BROKE INTO MY HOME..."
msgstr "언젠가 젊은 불한당 넷이 우리 집에 쳐들어왔지..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "Officer Major General Colonel...uh, I forgot my name."
msgstr "장교 소장 대령... 어, 내 이름을 잊었군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "This thing takes years to load. Two whole minutes..."
msgstr "이 물건은 장전하는 데 한세월이야. 꼬박 2분이라니..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid ""
"Tis' no sin to be born in the dirt. But it is a grave sin to want to stay "
"there."
msgstr "흙바닥에서 태어난 건 죄가 아니지. 거기에 주저앉으려는 건 큰 죄라네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/major.df"
msgid "You did me a damn good turn, picking me up."
msgstr "태워 줘서 정말 고맙네."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "...death, meth, heff, wreth?..."
msgstr "...전사, 검사, 발사, 반사?..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "...twice, thrice, dice, mice..."
msgstr "...두 번, 세 번, 주사위는 한 번, 쥐 잡는 건 매번..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "Between blades is connection, and through it flows conviction."
msgstr "칼날과 칼날이 맞닿으면 그사이로 신념이 흐르리."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "Does the toilet flush poo, or does it flush you?"
msgstr "변기 물을 내리면 똥이 쓸려가나, 그대가 쓸려가나?"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "I rhyme even when I snore, for all the speaking makes my throat sore."
msgstr "밤에도 운을 맞추느라 코를 골았소. 말을 너무 했더니 목이 쉬었소."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "I speak in rhyme for the flourish, but if I don't, I shall perish."
msgstr "멋 부리려고 운을 맞춘다오. 안 그러면 죽고 만다오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "I was fired from my previous job, for calling a non-rhymer a yob."
msgstr "예전 직장에선 해고당했소. 운도 못 맞추는 놈에게 바보라 했소."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "If you intend to drift, mighten I handle the gearshift?"
msgstr "차를 미끄러뜨리려는 참이오? 그럼 변속은 내게 맡기시오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "In order to see everything clear, look for the storage of beer."
msgstr "앞길을 또렷하게 보고 싶소? 맥주 창고부터 찾으시오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid ""
"It gets tiring to speak in rhyme, but I'm required to do it all the time."
msgstr "운을 맞추자니 진이 다 빠진다오. 그래도 한시도 쉴 수 없다오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "My home was an island nation -- oh wait look, a gas station!"
msgstr "내 고향은 바다 건너 섬이었소. 잠깐, 저기 주유소!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "Often the longest path is the one with the least wrath."
msgstr "가장 먼 길일수록 화낼 일이 적은 법이오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid ""
"On our path, the biggest barrier is to not imagine oneself as a warrior."
msgstr "길에서 가장 어려운 일은 제 한 몸 전사인 양 여기지 않는 일이오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "Once I gave the shogunate my heart; now I work part-time at Yallmart."
msgstr "한때는 막부를 위해 목숨을 걸었소. 이제는 얄마트에서 시급을 받소."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "Remember that coffee is great, but a lack of it will seal your fate."
msgstr "커피는 위대하오. 없으면 그대의 운명도 위태하오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "The firearm brings damage, but ammunition is expensive."
msgstr "총알 한 발에 적이 쓰러진다오. 총알 한 발 값에 나도 쓰러진다오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "The pursuit of an objective is it's own directive."
msgstr "목표를 좇는 것, 그것이 곧 갈 길을 정하는 법."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid ""
"There in the shadow of night, are when your pants are most tight. Hmm..."
msgstr "어둠 짙은 한밤중엔 바지가 유난히 꽉 낀다오. 음..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "These rhymes are exhausting, but I mustn't stop trying."
msgstr "운 맞추는 건 기진맥진한 일. 그래도 멈출 수는 없는 일."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "When one travels the road, your own spirit is towed."
msgstr "길을 가는 동안 영혼도 견인된다오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/shogun.df"
msgid "Wisdom is preferable to martyrdom."
msgstr "순교하기 전에 지혜를 구하시오."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:2
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "A gun or club is insigificant compared to the Jorts."
msgstr "총도 몽둥이도 청반바지 앞에서는 하찮다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "All I smell is fear and green beans."
msgstr "두려움과 풋콩 냄새밖에 안 나는군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:1
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "FIND THE CANADIANS - I WANT THEM ALIVE!"
msgstr "캐나다인들을 찾아라. 산 채로 데려와!"

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "I AM ALTERING THE OUTFIT. PRAY I DO NOT ALTER IT FURTHER."
msgstr "옷을 고치는 중이다. 더 고치지 않길 기도해라."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:3
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "I find your lack of American legwear disturbing."
msgstr "미국식 하의가 부족하군. 심히 불안하다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "I hate zombie guts. They stink, they're slimy and get everywhere."
msgstr "좀비 내장은 질색이다. 고약하고 끈적한 데다 사방에 묻어."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:12
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "I see you have constructed a car. Impressive."
msgstr "자동차를 조립했군. 인상적이다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "In Jorts lies strength."
msgstr "힘은 청반바지에 깃든다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "May the fashion be with you."
msgstr "패션이 그대와 함께하기를."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "NOOOoOooOOoOoooooh! My toe."
msgstr "안 돼에에에에! 내 발가락."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "PROGRESS ON THIS ROAD HAS BEEN...SLOW."
msgstr "이 길에서의 전진은... 느리군."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "Prepare my vapourblade for arrival."
msgstr "도착하는 대로 증기검을 준비해라."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "Search for the Jorts within you."
msgstr "네 안의 청반바지를 찾아라."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "THE ACTOR IS GONE. THE JORTS ARE WHAT REMAIN."
msgstr "배우는 떠났다. 청반바지만 남았다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "THE DAWN OF THE DARK JORTS DRAWS NEARER."
msgstr "어둠의 청반바지가 떠오를 날이 가까웠다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "THE DIRECTOR IS NOT AS FORGIVING AS I AM."
msgstr "감독님은 나만큼 관대하지 않다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "The Dark Jorts will clear the way."
msgstr "어둠의 청반바지가 길을 열어 줄 것이다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "The Jorts are with you...but you are no dingus yet."
msgstr "청반바지가 그대와 함께하는군... 그래도 아직 얼간이는 아니다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "The jeans, the jackets, and the denims too..."
msgstr "청바지도, 재킷도, 데님이라면 전부..."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:10
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "There is no power equivalent to the Jorts."
msgstr "청반바지에 필적할 힘은 없다."

#: deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/blurb/syca_sc/vapours.df"
msgid "inhale...exhale...inhale..."
msgstr "들이쉬고... 내쉬고... 들이쉬고..."

