#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:311
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" after giving weight tips and talking about how they bury all their horrible"
" thoughts. A flawless strategy!"
msgstr ""
"을(를) 털 생각은 잊어버린다. 대신 웨이트 조언을 건네고 끔찍한 생각을 마음속에 묻어 두는 이야기를 나눈다. 완벽한 작전이다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid " is one of them!"
msgstr "도 자기들 편이라는 뜻이다!"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
" stands tall in front of the bandits, unafraid, and gives a defiant speech."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자 앞에 겁 없이 우뚝 서서 도전적인 연설을 한다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:329
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ": STOICISM"
msgstr ": 금욕주의"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:309
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid ""
"IT IS NOT THE MUSCLE THAT FLEXES HARDEST THAT WINS...BUT THE MUSCLE THAT "
"FLEXES LONGEST. SUN TZU SAID THAT."
msgstr "가장 세게 힘주는 근육이 이기는 게 아니다... 가장 오래 힘주는 근육이 이긴다. 손자가 한 말이다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:311
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "They forget about robbing "
msgstr "약탈자들은"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit1.df"
msgid "This incomprehensible wisdom can only mean that "
msgstr "도무지 알아들을 수 없는 이 지혜는 곧"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " and let "
msgstr "에게 나눠 주고"

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " fixes the bandit group's wounds with ease! There's even time for "
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들의 상처를 손쉽게 치료한다! 시간도 남았다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid " has permanently increased their pathfinding knowledge."
msgstr "은(는) 길 찾기 지식을 영구적으로 얻었다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid ""
" to teach them how to stitch wounds themselves and access their 'personality"
" type', whatever that means."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들에게 상처를 직접 꿰매는 법과, 그게 뭔진 몰라도 자기 안의 '성격 유형'을 끌어내는 법을 알려 준다."

#: deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/bandit/bandit2.df"
msgid "The bandits share their knowledge of the region with "
msgstr "약탈자들은 이 지역에 대해 아는 것을"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " drinks so much gas that they come hyper. The feeling is great!"
msgstr "은(는) 기름을 잔뜩 마셔서 흥분 상태가 된다. 기분이 끝내준다!"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid " is "
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/camp/camp1.df"
msgid "POWERED UP!"
msgstr "파워 업!"

#: deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df:715
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/PANCREAS.df"
msgid ""
"This character gets stamina and power bonuses for hitting zombies at the "
"furthest tip of his melee range! He also has a 35% chance of getting "
"explosive results from his tip attacks!"
msgstr ""
"이 캐릭터는 근접 사거리 맨 끝으로 좀비를 맞히면 스태미나와 위력 보너스를 받는다! 끝부분 공격은 35% 확률로 폭발하기도 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:948
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid " looks around, confused. He has some kind of staff."
msgstr "은(는) 당황한 채 주위를 둘러본다. 지팡이 같은 걸 들고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df:947
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/STOMACH.df"
msgid ""
"When the group exits their car, heavenly music plays. White flashes in their"
" eyes. In front of them, some sort of goblin looking magic thing "
"materialises."
msgstr "일행이 차에서 내리자 천상의 음악이 흐른다. 눈앞에 흰빛이 번쩍이더니 고블린처럼 생긴 마법적인 존재가 나타난다."

#: deathforth/events/common/UVULA.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/UVULA.df"
msgid " INCREASED!"
msgstr "이 증가했다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/UVULA.df:168
