msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common1.df"
msgid "'s spirit!"
msgstr "의 기운이 완전히 돌아왔다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common1.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common1.df"
msgid ""
", disinfecting it, dressing it, stitching it, and even singing little songs."
msgstr "이나 쓴다. 소독하고, 붕대를 감고, 꿰매고, 심지어 콧노래까지 부른다."

