msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common1.df"
msgid ""
"The party is too crowded! The deer runs away due to social anxiety. Maybe it"
" had something cooking at home, you never know."
msgstr "일행이 너무 많다! 사슴은 낯을 가려서 도망간다. 집에서 요리하던 게 있을지도 모르지."

