msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common1.df"
msgid ""
"This level of obsession annoys the group, but they understand that it's "
"necessary."
msgstr "일행은 이 정도 집착에 짜증이 나지만, 필요한 일이라는 건 이해한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common1.df:150
#: deathforth/events/common/common1.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common1.df"
msgid "With "
msgstr "<EMPTY>"

#: deathforth/events/common/common1.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common1.df"
msgid "With nobody else around, there's no complaining or bugging! "
msgstr "주변에 아무도 없으니 불평도 방해도 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common1.df:206
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common1.df"
msgid "hours and hours"
