msgstr "은(는) 얼간이의 목이 쉬고 나서야 통과할 수 있었다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:648
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" leads an intense fitness regimen with pretend rowing, burpees, jumping "
"jacks, planking and more. Repeat until "
msgstr "은(는) 노 젓는 시늉, 버피, 팔 벌려 뛰기, 플랭크가 포함된 강도 높은 운동을 이끈다. 이 말이 나올 때까지 반복한다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" listens for hours and hours, with the patience of a saint. Even when the "
"conversation turns weird, "
msgstr "은(는) 성인군자처럼 인내심을 발휘해 몇 시간이고 듣는다. 이야기가 이상해져도"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:436
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
" vast medical knowledge to quickly fix up her leg AND give therapy, without "
"even needing to expend medical supplies."
msgstr "폭넓은 의학 지식으로 의료용품도 쓰지 않고 그녀의 다리를 금세 치료하고 심리 상담까지 해 준다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:481
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ": Provide care"
msgstr ": 돌봐 준다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:437
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid ""
"She gives what she has left as thanks. Another win for Freudian-Jungian-"
"Dinkian psychology!"
msgstr "그녀는 고마움의 표시로 남은 물자를 건넨다. 프로이트, 융, 얼간이 심리학의 또 한 번의 승리!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common2.df:648
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common2.df"
msgid "TOO FIT TO QUIT"
msgstr "멈추기엔 너무 튼튼해!!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
" gives a speech, trying to connect with the man. It's mostly just wrong pop "
"psychology and corny old allegories."
msgstr "은(는) 남자의 마음을 얻으려고 연설한다. 대부분 엉터리 대중 심리학과 진부한 비유다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid " loses him easily."
msgstr "은(는) 어렵지 않게 남자를 따돌린다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "...what?"
msgstr "...뭐라고?"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ": Try to calm him down"
msgstr ": 진정시키려 한다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid ""
"I KNOW HOW YOU FEEL...THERE'S LIGHT AT THE END OF THE SHIP. WE'LL BURN THAT "
"BRIDGE WHEN WE GET TO IT."
msgstr "네 기분 알아... 배 끝에는 빛이 있는 법이지. 다리까지 가면 그때 불을 지르면 돼."

#: deathforth/events/common/common3.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common3.df"
msgid "The man is too confused to continue his rant! "
msgstr "남자는 너무 혼란스러워서 더는 고함을 지르지 못한다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:522
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" finds a healing spray in the spider's nest! Maybe somebody mistaked it for "
"bugspray."
msgstr "은(는) 거미집에서 회복 스프레이를 찾는다! 누군가 살충제로 착각한 모양이다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:512
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
" holds the creature in their hand, petting it gently. This isn't so bad!"
msgstr "은(는) 손바닥 위에 녀석을 올리고 살며시 쓰다듬는다. 생각보다 괜찮다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " saw it on a website, so it MUST be true!"
msgstr "이(가) 인터넷에서 봤으니 틀림없이 사실이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " utilises their long-held best nugget of psychology: "
msgstr "은(는) 오래 간직해 온 최고의 심리학 비법을 꺼낸다."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid " will remember this lesson in future!"
msgstr "은(는) 이 교훈을 두고두고 기억할 것이다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:518
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "'s arm!"
msgstr "의 팔을 타고 거미가 올라간다!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ": JUST GIVE UP"
msgstr ": 그냥 포기해"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:537
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ": Pet creature"
msgstr ": 녀석을 쓰다듬는다"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:523
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "HEALSPRAY GET!"
msgstr "회복 스프레이 획득!"

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid ""
"It really is that simple! Just give up and make your peace with the "
"impossible. "
msgstr "정말 그게 다야! 포기하고 불가능한 건 받아들여."

#: deathforth/events/common/common4.df:236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/common4.df"
msgid "JUST GIVE UP!"
msgstr "그냥 포기해!"

