#: deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df:240
msgctxt "deathforth/events/common/cyoa-k-newbie.df"
msgid ""
"Nurturing is now an independent personality type, akin to charming or tinker. There's a whole host of new accessibility and difficulty options too,\r\n"
"\tand a bunch of new weapon classes to read about and try."
msgstr ""
"보살핌은 이제 매력적, 땜장이처럼 독립된 성격 유형이다. 접근성과 난이도 설정이 여럿 추가됐고,\r\n"
"\t새 무기 종류도 알아보고 써 볼 수 있다."

