#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1636
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " SHRIEKS "
msgstr "은(는) 비명을 지른다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" This statement is so insightful, everybody is forced to stop and think. "
"Even the dogs."
msgstr "참으로 통찰력 있는 말이라 모두가 멈춰 서서 곰곰이 생각한다. 개들조차도."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1830
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" accidentally activates a hidden voice command module in the train! It "
"brakes and grinds to a halt in front of the supplies."
msgstr "은(는) 우연히 열차의 숨겨진 음성 명령 장치를 작동시킨다! 열차가 브레이크를 밟고 끼익 소리를 내며 물자 앞에 멈춰 선다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1693
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " are attached to their legs!"
msgstr "이(가) 다리에 붙어 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1723
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " at full speed."
msgstr "을(를) 전속력으로 들이받는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1823
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " at the train, which continues to hurtle toward them."
msgstr "그래도 열차는 계속 이쪽으로 돌진한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1445
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " bandits scatter away."
msgstr "약탈자들이 뿔뿔이 흩어진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1436
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " beats back the rest of the bandits, but is injured in the process."
msgstr "은(는) 나머지 약탈자들을 물리치지만 그 과정에서 다친다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1723
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " becomes suddenly much more aware of it when the train collides with "
msgstr "은(는) 뒤늦게 열차를 알아차린다. 이미 열차는"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1678
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " begins to feel increasingly tired and dizzy."
msgstr "은(는) 기운이 빠지고 어지러워진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1473
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " blows through the bandits."
msgstr "이 약탈자들을 휩쓸고 지나간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1837
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " boards the train to find even more useful items on board! "
msgstr "은(는) 열차에 올라 더 쓸 만한 물건을 찾아낸다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1621
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" busts up their leg real bad! At least the disgusting leeches are gone."
msgstr "은(는) 제 다리를 심하게 다친다! 적어도 징그러운 거머리들은 떨어졌다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1653
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " continues to function as normal."
msgstr "은(는) 평소와 다름없이 움직인다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1677
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" decides to just ignore the leeches. There's surely no way that this could "
"backfire, right?"
msgstr "은(는) 거머리 따위 그냥 무시하기로 한다. 별일 없겠지?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1868
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " decides to..."
msgstr "은(는) 마음을 정한다..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " distracts them - 3 food"
msgstr "이(가) 주의를 돌린다 - 식량 3"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1637
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " dizzy and nauseous."
msgstr "이(가) 어지럽고 메스껍다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1722
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't even realise that the train is there; completely lost in their own "
"thoughts."
msgstr "은(는) 딴생각에 푹 빠져 열차가 있는 줄도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1648
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't understand what all the fuss is about, and didn't feel anything. "
"Their legs must have always looked like that!"
msgstr "은(는) 다들 왜 유난인지 이해하지 못한다. 아무렇지도 않았다. 자기 다리는 원래 그렇게 생겼을 것이다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1693
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " dunks their feet right into a sunken puddle. When they lift it up, "
msgstr "은(는) 움푹 팬 웅덩이에 발을 푹 담근다. 들어 올리니"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1574
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" figures that since dogs are scared of fireworks, a gun would provide a "
"similar effect. A gun is basically just a firework in a tube or something. I"
" dunno, I'm not an engineer."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 개들이 불꽃놀이를 무서워하니 총도 비슷한 효과가 있으리라 생각한다. 총도 관에 넣은 폭죽 같은 거잖아. 뭐, 내가 기술자는 "
"아니니까."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1446
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " figures that the bandits must've been really scared of heights."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈자들이 높은 곳을 정말 무서워했을 거라 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1842
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " finds a very popular athletics manual."
msgstr "은(는) 아주 인기 있는 운동 교본을 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1839
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " finds a very popular tinkering encyclopedia."
msgstr "은(는) 아주 인기 있는 공작 백과사전을 찾는다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" fires off a couple rounds into the sky and the wolf pack shrieks in fear! "
"The dogs become too timid to fight!"
msgstr "은(는) 하늘에 몇 발 쏜다. 늑대 무리가 겁에 질려 낑낑댄다! 겁을 먹은 개들은 덤비지 못한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1456
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " follows behind."
msgstr "이(가) 뒤따른다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1756
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " gets lost for a day trying to find their way back."
msgstr "은(는) 돌아가는 길을 찾다가 하루를 꼬박 헤맨다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1494
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " gets to pass for free."
msgstr "은(는) 통행료 없이 지나간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1620
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" grabs a piece of wood and starts thwacking their knees, trying to kill the "
"leeches with good old physical violence. In short, this is always a very bad"
" idea."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 막대기를 집어 들고 제 무릎을 두들기기 시작한다. 힘으로 거머리를 잡겠다는 건데, 한마디로 절대 해선 안 될 짓이다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1730
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" grabs the supplies and makes it out in time with ease! The train roars "
"past."
msgstr "은(는) 물자를 챙기고 여유롭게 빠져나온다! 열차가 굉음을 내며 지나간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1480
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " had no idea they would take that quite so literally."
msgstr "은(는) 그 말을 그렇게까지 곧이곧대로 들을 줄 몰랐다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " hands over their food for safety. When "
msgstr "은(는) 안전을 위해 식량을 넘긴다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1501
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" hands over their gas, as agreed. The bandits wander off to their cozy "
"campsite somewhere in the distance."
msgstr "은(는) 약속한 대로 기름을 넘긴다. 약탈자들은 저 멀리 아늑한 야영지로 돌아간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1777
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" has no problem sprinting down the track to grab the supplies, and makes it "
"back before the train even presents a threat."
msgstr "은(는) 선로를 따라 쏜살같이 달려가 물자를 챙기고, 열차가 위협이 되기도 전에 돌아온다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1589
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" investigates, a wolf pack surrounds them. A man steps out from a tent, "
"armed with a shotgun and clicker."
msgstr "이(가) 살피러 가자 늑대 무리가 에워싼다. 산탄총과 개 훈련용 클리커를 든 남자가 천막 밖으로 걸어 나온다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1508
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is "
msgstr "은(는)"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is able to get away unscathed. That was close!"
msgstr "은(는) 무사히 빠져나온다. 아슬아슬했다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1433
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is being escorted down the mountain, they push one of the bandits into a "
"chasm!"
msgstr "은(는) 산 아래로 끌려가던 중 약탈자 한 명을 낭떠러지로 밀어 버린다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is built different. As hardy and manical as any bovine, they tear through "
"the horde one-by-one, suplexing and batting away the bison."
msgstr "은(는) 차원이 다르다. 들소만큼 튼튼하고 미쳐 날뛰며, 한 마리씩 수플렉스로 꽂고 쳐 날려 무리를 헤친다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1750
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is not nearly fast enough to outrun the train and grab the supplies. In a "
"last ditch effort to save themselves, they dive off the bridge into the "
"water."
msgstr "은(는) 열차보다 먼저 물자를 챙길 만큼 빠르지 않다. 살아남으려고 마지막으로 다리에서 물속으로 뛰어든다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1860
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is safe."
msgstr "은(는) 무사하다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1650
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is so incredibly calm that the rest of the group assumes that everything "
"must be fine, and calms down."
msgstr "이(가) 너무나 침착해서, 나머지도 별일 없다고 생각하고 진정한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1483
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " is still rolling and bouncing."
msgstr "은(는) 아직도 통통 튀면서 굴러 내려간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1867
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" is talking a waltz along an old railway bridge when a runaway train veers "
"round the corner, headed straight for "
msgstr "은(는) 오래된 철교를 느긋하게 걷는다. 그때 폭주하는 열차가 굽이를 돌아 나타나 선로에 있는"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " knows that leeches are valuable for niche medical situations."
msgstr "은(는) 거머리가 특정한 경우에 의료용으로 쓸모 있다는 걸 안다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1453
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " knows they can use their agility to escape the bandits."
msgstr "은(는) 날렵함을 살려 약탈자들에게서 벗어날 수 있다는 걸 안다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " looks back, the dogs are fighting over their chow."
msgstr "이(가) 돌아보니 개들이 먹이를 두고 싸우고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1825
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" makes little whining noises at the train. How anybody is supposed to "
"interpret this is a mystery."
msgstr "은(는) 열차를 향해 가늘게 낑낑댄다. 대체 누가 그걸 알아듣는단 말인가."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1558
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" noticed the paw footprints in the floor and took a tin of dog food with "
"them. They lob it right in the centre of the pack!"
msgstr "은(는) 바닥에 찍힌 발자국을 눈여겨보고 개 사료 통조림을 챙겨 왔다. 무리 한가운데로 집어던진다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1483
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " off the cliff-side. Half an hour later, "
msgstr "을(를) 절벽 밖으로 밀어 버린다. 30분이 지나도"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1867
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " on the track."
msgstr "를 향해 돌진한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1529
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " outpositions them"
msgstr "이(가) 유리한 자리를 잡는다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1667
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " panics and can't figure out what to do!"
msgstr "은(는) 겁에 질려 어쩔 줄 모른다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1679
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " passes out! When they wake up again, a zombie is trying to eat them."
msgstr "은(는) 기절한다! 정신을 차려 보니 좀비가 잡아먹으려 하고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" plucks off the leeches expertly and stores them away for later safekeeping."
" No big deal!"
msgstr "은(는) 능숙하게 거머리를 떼어 내 나중에 쓰게 챙겨 둔다. 별일 아니다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1469
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " poops themselves. The bandits are unsure how to interpret this."
msgstr "은(는) 바지에 똥을 싼다. 약탈자들은 이걸 어떻게 받아들여야 할지 모르겠다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1433
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " pretends to surrender. While "
msgstr "은(는) 항복하는 척한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1719
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " runs forward to try to pick up the supplies and escape in time."
msgstr "은(는) 제때 물자를 챙겨 달아나려고 앞으로 뛰어나간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" runs in to grab the supplies. Through sheer luck or skill, they just barely"
" manage to grab most of the supplies before the train hurtles past."
msgstr "은(는) 물자를 챙기러 뛰어든다. 운이 좋았든 실력이 좋았든, 열차가 스쳐 지나가기 직전에 대부분의 물자를 가까스로 건진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " scares the pack"
msgstr "이(가) 무리를 겁준다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1493
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" sets up on a hidden ledge and blasts the bandits from range! They don't "
"even know where they're being shot from!"
msgstr "은(는) 숨어 있던 바위턱에서 멀찍이 약탈자들에게 총을 쏜다! 약탈자들은 어디서 쏘는지도 모른다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1665
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" skims through their clothing and removes each leech carefully, using old "
"credit cards and salt. After a while, they relent and fall off."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 옷을 샅샅이 살피고 낡은 신용 카드와 소금으로 거머리를 하나씩 조심스레 떼어 낸다. 얼마 뒤 거머리들이 버티다 못해 떨어진다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1492
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " sneaks up to higher ground."
msgstr "은(는) 몰래 높은 곳으로 올라간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1454
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " starts sprinting and diving between various geographical features. "
msgstr "은(는) 험한 지형을 이리저리 뛰고 구르며 뚫고 나간다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1551
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " takes a whole bunch of dog food and fresh meat from the campsite."
msgstr "은(는) 야영지에서 개 사료와 신선한 고기를 잔뜩 챙긴다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1878
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " tells the train to cool it"
msgstr "이(가) 열차에게 진정하라고 한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1637
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid " throughout the day, making "
msgstr "을(를) 하루 종일 괴롭힌다. 그 탓에"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df:1508
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/sycamore_events.df"
msgid ""
" up a set of steep hills when a group of bandits jump out from seemingly "
"nowhere."
msgstr "가파른 언덕을 오르던 중 약탈자 무리가 느닷없이 튀어나온다."

