#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:193
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid " breathes heavily for a moment, and then has a coughing fit."
msgstr "은(는) 잠시 거칠게 숨을 몰아쉬다가 기침을 해 댄다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
" demands that you wear this skintight, vein-crushing pair of jorts to prove "
"yourself worthy."
msgstr "은(는) 피부에 착 달라붙고 핏줄이 눌리는 이 청반바지를 입어야 자격을 증명할 수 있다고 한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:228
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid " explodes like a burst balloon. Whoops!"
msgstr "은(는) 터진 풍선처럼 폭발한다. 이런!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
" farts manically in their direction. A little poop comes out. The message "
"was clear enough."
msgstr "은(는) 그쪽을 향해 미친 듯이 방귀를 뀐다. 똥도 조금 나온다. 뜻은 충분히 전해졌다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid " is already evil"
msgstr "은(는) 이미 악당이다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid " is just barely able to pull them up! The feeling is awful!"
msgstr "은(는) 가까스로 바지를 끌어올린다! 기분이 끔찍하다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:195
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
" is really confused, but accepts this as a reasonable alternative. Their "
"mind is blasted with knowledge about flexible jortswear!"
msgstr "은(는) 어리둥절해하면서도 합리적인 대안으로 받아들인다. 신축성 있는 청반바지에 관한 지식이 머릿속에 쏟아진다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid " struggles for a full hour with the jorts."
msgstr "은(는) 꼬박 한 시간 동안 청반바지와 씨름한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid " thinks about your feedback."
msgstr "은(는) 그 말을 곰곰이 생각한다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "'s legs permanently!"
msgstr "의 다리가 영구적으로 손상된다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ": ACTING IS FOR DORKS"
msgstr ": 연기는 찌질이들이나 하는 거야"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "ACTING IS FOR DORKS! YOU'RE AN ACTOR, THAT MAKES YOU A MEGA DORK."
msgstr "연기는 찌질이들이나 하는 거야! 넌 배우니까 왕찌질이네."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:231
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "BANG!"
msgstr "쾅!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "DO NOT CHOKE ON YOUR ASPIRATIONS"
msgstr "야망에 숨 막히지 않기를"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:172
#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:193
#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Dark Vapours"
msgstr "다크 베이퍼스"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:214
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "EXECUTE ORDER...6-7"
msgstr "명령... 6-7호를 실행하라"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:217
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Eventually, "
msgstr "결국"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "For a few tense moments, "
msgstr "긴장된 순간에"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "GIMME ALL YOUR STUFF! NOW!"
msgstr "가진 거 전부 내놔! 당장!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:183
#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:207
#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Kick someone from the group:"
msgstr "일행에서 뺄 사람:"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Leave this for now"
msgstr "지금은 그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:233
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "MOVESPEED DECREASED!"
msgstr "이동 속도 감소!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"PERHAPS YOU'RE RIGHT. I'LL JOIN YOU. SHOW ME HOW I SHOULD DO BETTER, AND "
"WE'LL RULE THE MIDWEST, FATHER AND SON."
msgstr ""
"네 말이 맞을지도 모르겠군. 합류하겠다. 내가 어떻게 고쳐야 할지 알려 줘라. 너와 내가 아버지와 아들로 중서부를 지배하는 거다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "POP!"
msgstr "펑!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you can convince him to join you by proving you like jorts, whatever"
" that means."
msgstr "청반바지를 좋아한다는 걸 증명하면 합류하도록 설득할 수도 있다. 대체 그게 무슨 소리인지는 몰라도."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Pick somebody to show jort devotion"
msgstr "청반바지에 대한 충성을 증명할 사람을 고른다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "RETURN OF THE DINK"
msgstr "얼간이의 귀환"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:275
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "STELLAR CONFLICT: SECRET PLANS"
msgstr "항성 전쟁: 비밀 설계도"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Should somebody try the jorts?"
msgstr "누가 청반바지를 입어 볼까?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Show your Jort Devotion"
msgstr "청반바지에 대한 충성을 증명한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:174
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "So wholesome!"
msgstr "훈훈하네!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"THE DARK SIDE OF THE JORTS FLOWS IN YOU. I WILL JOIN YOU, AND WE SHALL RULE "
"TOGETHER."
msgstr "네 안에는 청반바지의 어두운 면이 흐르는군. 합류하겠다. 우리 함께 지배하는 거다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"THE DARK SIDE OF THE JORTS IS A PATH TO SOMETHING MANY "
"CONSIDER...UNFASHIONABLE."
msgstr "청반바지의 어두운 면으로 들어서면 많은 이가... 촌스럽다고 여기는 경지에 이를 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "THE MEN, THE WOMEN, THE DINKS TOO..."
msgstr "남자도, 여자도, 얼간이들도..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "THESE PANTS ARE FULLY OPERATIONAL"
msgstr "이 바지는 완전히 작동한다"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"The jorts are so tight they cause muscle atrophy! The cheap material chafes "
"against their legs!"
msgstr "청반바지가 얼마나 꽉 끼는지 근육이 위축될 정도다! 싸구려 천이 다리를 쓸리게 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "The jorts tear themselves apart! The force and strain damages"
msgstr "청반바지가 쫙 찢어진다! 그 압력과 충격으로"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:225
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"These jorts are way too tight! The jorts compress against their legs and "
"waist, until..."
msgstr "이 청반바지는 너무 꽉 낀다! 천이 다리와 허리를 조여 오더니..."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"This character wields a phaseblade and can lift objects from ludicrous "
"distances."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 위상검을 쓰고 터무니없이 먼 거리에서도 물체를 들어 올릴 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"This interstellar tyrant (man in a costume) has been waiting for orders from"
" the director!"
msgstr "이 성간 폭군(분장한 남자)은 감독의 명령을 기다려 왔다!"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "WARNING: JORT-ING CAN BE LETHAL"
msgstr "경고: 청반바지는 목숨을 위협할 수 있음"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid "Who should wear these really tight jorts?"
msgstr "누가 이 꽉 끼는 청반바지를 입을까?"

#: deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/stomach/tantiveiv.df"
msgid ""
"You will have to do something extraordinary to prove your devotion to the "
"dark side."
msgstr "어두운 면에 대한 충성을 증명하려면 비범한 일을 해야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:35
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character buffs nearby teammates offensively or defensively and wields "
"a flintlock."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 근처 동료의 공격이나 방어를 강화하고 부싯돌 권총을 쓴다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:55
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character can attack rapidly with SWAP - use it on hordes! It's good "
"with polearms. This character also crits more often."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 교체 버튼으로 빠르게 공격한다. 좀비 떼에게 써 보자! 장병기와 잘 맞고 치명타도 더 자주 터진다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character has a powerful phaseblade and lobs objects for devastating "
"effect."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 강력한 위상검을 쓰고 물건을 집어 던져 큰 피해를 준다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character has a powerful water hose to control hordes and is fireproof."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 좀비 무리를 제어하는 강력한 소방 호스가 있고, 불에 타지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:65
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"This character has multiple ways to blow stuff to smithereens. He's also "
"blast resistant."
msgstr "이 캐릭터는 여러 방법으로 물건을 산산조각 낸다. 폭발에도 강하다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:54 deathforth/events/testregion.df:64
#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"Try out the new character for free! You can find them here, but in the new "
"update, they'll be elsewhere instead."
msgstr "새 캐릭터를 무료로 써 보자! 지금은 여기 있지만, 새 업데이트에서는 다른 곳에서 만날 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:34 deathforth/events/testregion.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid ""
"Try out the new character for free! You can find them here, but in the new "
"update, they'll be found elsewhere instead."
msgstr "새 캐릭터를 무료로 써 보자! 지금은 여기 있지만, 새 업데이트에서는 다른 곳에서 만날 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/testregion.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/testregion.df"
msgid "Wruff does this character do? Oh how I wonder..."
msgstr "멍? 이 캐릭터는 뭘 할까? 아, 정말 궁금하네..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:441
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "Recruit him - 10 food"
msgstr "그를 영입한다 - 식량 10"

#: deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df:443
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/camp-recruit.df"
msgid "You need 10 food to recruit him to the party."
msgstr "그를 일행으로 영입하려면 식량 10이 필요하다."

