msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " However, your teammates are carrying an rechargeable weapon."
msgstr "그래도 동료가 충전할 수 있는 무기를 들고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1216
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1276
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " However, your teammates are carrying an upgradeable weapon."
msgstr "그래도 동료가 강화할 수 있는 무기를 들고 있다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1328
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " attempts the recharge"
msgstr "이(가) 충전을 시도한다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1206
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " attempts the upgrade"
