#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1220
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1282
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1342
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " can't spare the time or food for an upgrade."
msgstr "은(는) 강화에 시간이나 식량을 쓸 여유가 없다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1174
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1236
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " even adds some "
msgstr "은(는) 심지어"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " is able to recharge their weapon! "
msgstr "은(는) 무기 충전에 성공한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1174
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1236
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " is able to upgrade their weapon! "
msgstr "은(는) 무기 강화에 성공한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1331
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " is not holding an rechargeable weapon."
msgstr "은(는) 충전할 수 있는 무기를 들고 있지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1209
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " is not holding an upgradeable weapon."
msgstr "은(는) 강화할 수 있는 무기를 들고 있지 않다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1201
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1261
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " one day"
msgstr "하루와 하루치 식량"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1180
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1242
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1304
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid ""
" stays up all night tinkering with their weapon but can't figure out how to "
"fit the components! They manage not to break the weapon, but nothing more."
msgstr "은(는) 밤새 무기를 만지작거리지만 부품을 어떻게 끼우는지 알아내지 못한다! 무기를 부수지 않은 게 다행이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1201
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1261
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid " takes"
msgstr "에 드는 비용은"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid ""
" works through the night attempting to recharge their weapon. It's a long, "
"arduous process."
msgstr "은(는) 밤새 무기를 충전하려 애쓴다. 길고 힘든 과정이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1170
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid ""
" works through the night attempting to upgrade their weapon. It's a long, "
"arduous process."
msgstr "은(는) 밤새 무기를 강화하려 애쓴다. 길고 힘든 과정이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1174
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1236
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df:1298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-shared.df"
msgid ", although it's unclear what advantage this yields."
