"You can modify screenshake on or off. This will be universal, applying to "
"firearms, explosions and more. You can also toggle flashy text."
msgstr "총기와 폭발 등에서 발생하는 모든 화면 흔들림을 켜거나 끌 수 있다. 글자 점멸도 조정할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/zombotown.df:408
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/zombotown.df"
msgid ""
"You can modify storm and rain effects. You can turn storms on or off, or "
"just remove the darkness."
msgstr "폭풍과 비 효과를 조정할 수 있다. 폭풍을 켜거나 끌 수도 있고, 어둠만 없앨 수도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/zombotown.df:530
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/zombotown.df"
msgid "Zombies have been returned to their original 5 HP baseline."
msgstr "좀비 체력이 기존 기본값인 5로 돌아왔다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " clubs, "
msgstr "곤봉류,"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:730
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " loyalty, at least "
msgstr "이상의 충성심과 최소"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:730
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " medical."
msgstr "이상의 의술이 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " polearms, "
msgstr "장병기,"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid " reach weapons,"
msgstr "장거리 근접 무기,"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:637
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "...PRICK"
msgstr "...재수 없는 놈"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:802
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "A good flail can shine with any TSTC or Hidden Potential char."
msgstr "좋은 도리깨라면 '근육이 감당 안 돼'나 '숨은 잠재력'을 가진 캐릭터가 제 위력을 낼 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:855
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"As the wielder's mechanical stat increases, mech weapon reload intervals "
"decrease dramatically."
msgstr "무기를 든 캐릭터의 기계 기술이 높을수록 기계식 무기의 재장전 간격이 크게 줄어든다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:770
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Clubs have awful stats, but have forced knockdown, accumulate fatigue slowly"
" and don't lose damage from fatigue."
msgstr "곤봉은 기본 성능이 형편없지만 무조건 넘어뜨리고, 피로가 천천히 쌓이며, 피로 때문에 피해량이 줄지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:792
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Consider these weapons on high crit and high fitness characters - more "
"attacks = more crits!"
msgstr "치명타 확률과 체력이 높은 캐릭터에게 들려 줘 봐. 많이 때릴수록 치명타도 자주 터지니까!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:856
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Consider using these weapons on gungineer and tinker type characters."
msgstr "총기 기술자나 땜장이에게 들려 줘 보자."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:586
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Contributed the PANCREAS, MANDIBLE, QUADRICEPS, RETINA, STOMACH, TRACHEA and"
" UVULA updates."
msgstr ""
"PANCREAS, MANDIBLE, QUADRICEPS, RETINA, STOMACH, TRACHEA, UVULA 업데이트에 기여했다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:811
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Different melee weapon archetypes might suit certain character builds "
"better."
msgstr "캐릭터 구성에 따라 어울리는 근접 무기 종류가 다르다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:761
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Each are different. Some spin, some are like boomerangs."
msgstr "무기마다 다르다. 회전하는 것도, 부메랑처럼 돌아오는 것도 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:801
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Flail damage scales with STR, with the damage floor and damage cap "
"increasing with tier."
msgstr "도리깨 피해량은 힘에 비례한다. 등급이 높을수록 최소 피해량과 최대 피해량이 모두 높아진다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:800
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Flails have high base cooldowns and can be unwieldy to use properly, and "
"cannot crit."
msgstr "도리깨는 기본 재사용 대기시간이 길고 다루기 까다로우며, 치명타가 터지지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:812
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "For example, TSTC characters are ideal for flails."
msgstr "예를 들어 '근육이 감당 안 돼'를 가진 캐릭터는 도리깨와 잘 맞는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Here you turn off or modify certain features, or activate bonus challenges."
msgstr "여기서는 여러 기능을 끄거나 조정하고, 추가 도전 조건을 켤 수 있어."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "I have time-travelled to be here."
msgstr "여기 오려고 시간을 여행했어."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:587
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "I woke up today and all my car tires had popped. Isn't that odd?"
msgstr "오늘 일어났더니 차 타이어가 전부 터져 있더라고. 이상하지 않아?"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:769
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "In order of tier, clubs include "
msgstr "곤봉류를 등급순으로 나열하면"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "In order of tier, flails include "
msgstr "도리깨류를 등급순으로 나열하면"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:779
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "In order of tier, polearms include "
msgstr "장병기를 등급순으로 나열하면"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:789
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "In order of tier, reach weapons include "
msgstr "장거리 근접 무기를 등급순으로 나열하면"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Many thrown weapons exist: "
msgstr "투척 무기는 종류가 많다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Mechanical weapons are those that benefit from high mech stats, like "
msgstr "기계식 무기는 기계 기술이 높을수록 유리한 무기다. 예를 들면"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:739
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"More may be added in future, but this is unlikely now that each stat has a "
"respective personality archetype. Suggestions still welcome!"
msgstr "앞으로 더 추가될 수도 있지만, 이제 능력치마다 대응하는 성격이 있어 가능성은 낮다. 제안은 여전히 환영!"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:768
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON CLUBS"
msgstr "곤봉류 안내"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:798
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON FLAILS"
msgstr "도리깨류 안내"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:808
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON MELEE WEAPONS"
msgstr "근접 무기 안내"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:778
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON POLEARMS"
msgstr "장병기 안내"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:852
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON RANGED STATS: MECH WEAPONS"
msgstr "원거리 무기 능력치 안내: 기계식 무기"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:788
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON REACH WEAPONS"
msgstr "장거리 근접 무기 안내"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:759
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "NOTES ON THROWN WEAPONS"
msgstr "투척 무기 안내"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:740
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"No one combo is ideal or necessarily better than the other. Each has useful "
"or powerful interactions available."
msgstr "어느 조합이 완벽하거나 무조건 더 좋지는 않다. 각각 유용하거나 강력한 상호작용이 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:857
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "OK RAMBO"
msgstr "알았어요, 람보"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:780
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Polearms have a great balance of range, multi-hit, damage and cooldown."
msgstr "장병기는 사거리, 동시 타격, 피해량, 재사용 대기시간의 균형이 좋다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:634
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Simply interact with the various options around the emporium."
msgstr "상점 안을 돌아다니면서 설정할 항목을 직접 고르면 돼."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Some examples of melee types are: "
msgstr "근접 무기 종류로는"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:784
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study clubs"
msgstr "곤봉류 안내를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:814
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study flails"
msgstr "도리깨류 안내를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:870
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study mech weapons"
msgstr "기계식 무기 안내를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:826
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study melee weapons"
msgstr "근접 무기 안내를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:794
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study polearms"
msgstr "장병기 안내를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:804
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study reach weapons"
msgstr "장거리 근접 무기 안내를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:774
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "Study thrown weapons"
msgstr "투척 무기 안내를 읽는다"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:793
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS EXANERD"
msgstr "고마워요, 엑사 덕후"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:803
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS PETANERD"
msgstr "고마워요, 페타 덕후"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:764
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS RONNANERD"
msgstr "고마워요, 론나 덕후"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:813
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS TERANERD"
msgstr "고마워요, 테라 덕후"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:773
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS YOTTANERD"
msgstr "고마워요, 요타 덕후"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:783
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THANKS ZETTANERD"
msgstr "고마워요, 제타 덕후"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THE ACCESS EMPORIUM"
msgstr "접근성 상점"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "THEY KEEP MULTIPLYING. I NEED MORE ALLIES TO WIN. TELL YOUR FRIENDS"
msgstr "놈들이 계속 불어나고 있어. 이기려면 동료가 더 필요해. 친구들에게 전해 줘."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:791
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "The crit chance from reach weapons can stack with Fierce Hitter crits."
msgstr "장거리 근접 무기의 치명타 확률은 강타자의 치명타 확률과 중첩된다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:809
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "There are a variety of different classes of melee weapon types."
msgstr "근접 무기는 여러 종류로 나뉜다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:782
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "These kinds of weapons can be good on almost any character."
msgstr "이런 무기는 거의 어떤 캐릭터에게나 잘 맞는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:771
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "These weapons are ideal for support characters with low STR/FIT."
msgstr "힘이나 체력이 낮은 지원 캐릭터에게 이상적이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:772
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "They are also break-resilient, so can be dependable in the early-game."
msgstr "잘 부서지지도 않아서 게임 초반에 믿고 쓸 만하다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:854
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"This weapon class also benefits from shooting, but not as strongly as rifles"
" do. Flintlocks do AoE damage instead of penetrating."
msgstr "이 무기 종류도 사격 능력의 영향을 받지만 소총만큼은 아니다. 부싯돌 총은 적을 관통하는 대신 범위 피해를 준다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:762
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Throwing knives benefit from FIT, while chakrams and javelins benefit from "
"STR."
msgstr "투척용 단검은 체력의 영향을 받고, 차크람과 투창은 힘의 영향을 받는다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:790
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Unlike flails, reach weapons are great at critting. Every tier adds 10% "
"additional crit chance."
msgstr "도리깨와 달리 장거리 근접 무기는 치명타가 잘 터진다. 등급마다 치명타 확률이 10%p씩 더해진다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "War never changes."
msgstr "전쟁은 결코 변하지 않아."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:636
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"Well, mainly because I wanted to destroy the world. But also to be here."
msgstr "음, 주된 이유는 세계를 파괴하고 싶어서였어. 여기 오고 싶기도 했고."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:781
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"While polearms have good stats, they also accumulate fatigue at half the "
"usual rate."
msgstr "장병기는 성능이 좋고 피로도 평소의 절반 속도로 쌓인다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:763
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"You can hoard these weapons and then unleash them during a siege. They are "
"relatively stamina-efficient."
msgstr "이 무기들을 쌓아 뒀다가 포위전에서 풀어놓을 수 있다. 스태미나 소모가 비교적 적다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "and thrown."
msgstr "투척 무기 등이 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:760
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "boots, throwing knives, chakrams, javelins and more."
msgstr "장화, 투척용 단검, 차크람, 투창 등이 있다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:799
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "fishing harpoons, flails and the blue moon."
msgstr "낚시 작살, 도리깨, 블루 문이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:810
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "flails,"
msgstr "도리깨,"

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "greetings! welcome to the emporium."
msgstr "안녕! 접근성 상점에 온 걸 환영해."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:789
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "ladders, lances and naginatas."
msgstr "사다리, 랜스, 나기나타다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:769
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "mic stands, folding chairs, aztec and giant clubs."
msgstr "마이크 스탠드, 접이식 의자, 아즈텍 곤봉, 거대 곤봉이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:779
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "pool cues, tactical spears and golden spears."
msgstr "당구 큐, 전술 창, 황금 창이다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:940
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid ""
"represents a character's optimism and outlook. It affects zombie detection "
"radius, with a smaller radius at higher attitude."
msgstr "캐릭터가 얼마나 낙천적이고 긍정적인지 나타낸다. 태도가 높을수록 좀비가 캐릭터를 감지할 수 있는 반경이 줄어든다."

#: deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df:853
msgctxt "deathforth/events/unlock/ztown-npc.df"
msgid "tennis/scrap launchers and flintlocks."
msgstr "테니스공 발사기, 고철 발사기, 부싯돌 총이 있다."

#: deathforth/gamemodes.df:446
msgctxt "deathforth/gamemodes.df"
msgid ""
"They're back - and they're MEGABUFF. \r\n"
"\t\t> 15 days, 1x zombies \r\n"
"\t\t> As days pass, zombs become resistant...\r\n"
"\t\t> Zombies gain fire resist, mass and grapple strength!\r\n"
"\t\t> Winning raises max ZP by 5! \r\n"
"\t\t> Cruel bandits"
msgstr ""
"놈들이 돌아왔다. 엄청 빵빵해져서. \r\n"
"\t\t> 15일, 좀비 1배 \r\n"
